WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.304
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Roleplay!

2
00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:08.059
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:08.359 --> 00:00:10.556
Today's topic is Building Things.

4
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:16.896
Today we act out a conversation. I am the teacher and you are my friend.

5
00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:18.699
Hammer!

6
00:00:19.599 --> 00:00:21.670
Hammer. Your turn!

7
00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:25.514
Hammer!

8
00:00:25.814 --> 00:00:26.826
Great!

9
00:00:27.817 --> 00:00:28.678
Nail!

10
00:00:29.578 --> 00:00:31.766
Nail. Your turn!

11
00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:35.714
Nail!

12
00:00:36.014 --> 00:00:37.073
Wonderful!

13
00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:38.957
Saw!

14
00:00:39.857 --> 00:00:41.824
Saw. Your turn!

15
00:00:44.724 --> 00:00:45.539
Saw!

16
00:00:45.839 --> 00:00:46.620
Super!

17
00:00:47.617 --> 00:00:49.059
Screwdriver!

18
00:00:49.959 --> 00:00:52.576
Screwdriver. Your turn!

19
00:00:55.476 --> 00:00:56.512
Screwdriver!

20
00:00:56.812 --> 00:00:57.906
Excellent!

21
00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:00.417
Our sentence is:

22
00:01:00.717 --> 00:01:04.658
We use a hammer to hit a nail. We use a saw to cut wood.

23
00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:06.703
Say it with me!

24
00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:14.957
We use a hammer to hit a nail. We use a saw to cut wood.

25
00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.660
Hello, Malis! What can you build?

26
00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.424
We use a hammer to hit a nail.

27
00:01:21.724 --> 00:01:24.052
Nice! Do you like Hammer?

28
00:01:24.352 --> 00:01:26.609
Yes! I like Hammer.

29
00:01:27.617 --> 00:01:30.768
What can you build? Your turn to answer!

30
00:01:35.068 --> 00:01:37.834
We use a hammer to hit a nail.

31
00:01:38.134 --> 00:01:39.402
Great acting!

32
00:01:40.417 --> 00:01:45.475
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

33
00:01:45.775 --> 00:01:46.985
Bye-bye!

